   "notes": "Table 3 B1 row: V0=249.53 A^3/conventional cell, Z=4, K0=177 kbar=17.7 GPa, K0 prime fixed at 5. The thermal coefficient is the directly reported alpha0*K0=0.0195(5) kbar/K=0.00195(5) GPa/K, rather than the rounded product 177*0.00011. T0=23 degC=296.15 K. Table 1 retains all 30 entries: 23 measured sample states, six separate NaCl spot checks without KCl volumes, and one derived 23 degC ambient-volume anchor. No individual elastic errors or covariance are assigned. The Table 1 volume heading erroneously says B2-KCl; volumes and Z=4 identify the B1 sample. Complete unweighted joint refit is close but not exact; see the dedicated reproduction. The marginal P-T bounds do not define a rectangular B1 stability region.",
